# Vivi Ornitier, "{0}: Add X mana in any combination of {U} and/or {R}, where X is Vivi Ornitier's power. Activate only
# during your turn and only once each turn." Cast with no counters it is a 0/3, so the first activation adds nothing at
# all (CR 106.5) and still spends the turn's use (CR 602.5b), which a second activation that turn finds out.
# Two turns later a Lightning Bolt gives it a +1/+1 counter, and the activation then adds one mana of the colour chosen
# as it resolves; used again that turn, it is refused.

